---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import headshot from '../../assets/images/headshot2.jpeg'
---

<section id="about" data-about class="section-full relative flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
    <!-- Image -->
    <div class="relative" data-about-image>
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm clip-cut-corner">
        <Image
          src={headshot}
          alt="Faraz Qureshi"
          class="h-auto w-full object-cover"
          widths={[400, 600, 800]}
          sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-sm ring-2 ring-accent-orange/30" />
        <!-- Corner bracket overlay on image -->
        <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 h-4 w-4 border-t border-l border-accent-orange/40" />
        <div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 h-4 w-4 border-b border-r border-accent-orange/40" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Text -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
      <h2
        data-about-text
        class="font-display text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl"
      >
        The Short Version
      </h2>

      <p data-about-text class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
        I believe the best engineers don't just write code — they solve the problems no one else wants to touch. I chase the hardest thing on the board, ship it, then find the next one.
      </p>

      <p data-about-text class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
        Right now I'm building distributed systems at Tesla, where my pipelines process millions of events per day. Before that I shipped at Amazon AWS and Capital One, built two startups, and graduated from the University of Washington with degrees in Computer Science and Business.
      </p>

      <p data-about-text class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
        What sets me apart: I've been a founder three times. I know what it's like to raise money, hire a team, and ship under pressure — and I bring that urgency to every engineering role.
      </p>

      <div
        data-about-badge
        class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-sm bg-bg-elevated px-5 py-3 border-l-2 border-accent-orange ring-1 ring-border"
      >
        <div class="h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-accent-orange" />
        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary">
          Allen School of CSE + Foster School of Business — UW, 2024
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Transition line -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-12 left-0 right-0 text-center">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-text-muted uppercase">
      Here is what that looks like in numbers.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
